B.E7=new A.id("# State Management\n\nChangeNotifier + ListenableBuilder + immutable State.\n\n## Flow\n1. View calls a ViewModel method.\n2. ViewModel creates a new State.\n3. ViewModel calls notifyListeners().\n4. ListenableBuilder rebuilds the UI.\n...\n\n## Do not use setState for ViewModel changes\nPrefer:\nviewModel.notifyListeners();\n...\n\n## Adapting later\nIf the project already uses Riverpod, Provider, or Bloc,\nfollow the project style.",B.bx,null)
